{
  "post": {
    "id": "13135642",
    "published": "2017-05-25T03:08:04.000Z",
    "title": "遂に出会えましたね(o^^o)",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13135642.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170525061320/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13135642.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "4thシングル「day by day/鹿乃」が遂に昨日リリースされました(*ﾟ∀ﾟ*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第 4 张单曲《day by day／鹿乃》昨天终于发售了(*ﾟ∀ﾟ*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The 4th single \"day by day / Kano\" was finally released yesterday (*ﾟ∀ﾟ*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日は店舗さんへのご挨拶まわり、リリースイベントと盛りだくさんでした！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天真是行程满满：又是挨家拜访店铺，又有发行活动！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday was packed, with greeting visits to the stores and a release event!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_100APPLE_IMG_0507.JPG",
            "media": "6429d8ba6842.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hkS0--me6NHwNVBs9RHxLK08JMhN0Ny50ZywjRngCPlJ4OCN8ZS4hSncKdhV5D3YuTEV6H0gGDyhbDzNNeGQQWW83Fid3DDJXREokBihRYkgnbXIqMjR7EnoAakkobTYrNjV4HXtTPQ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アニメイト横浜さんでのトークイベント終わり、やはり降りましたよ。雨！！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Animate 横滨店的脱口秀活动一结束，雨果然还是落下来了。雨！！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After the talk event at Animate Yokohama ended, sure enough, it rained. Rain!! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "降水確率20%だったんだけどなあ…"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "明明降水概率只有 20% 的说……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The chance of rain was 20%, though..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日一緒に出演してくださったリスアニの澄川さんがトークイベント終わりにおそらくアメダス？をみて「横浜に雨雲がむかってきてる！笑」と笑っていたのはいい思い出です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天一起登台演出的 LisAni 的澄川さん，在脱口秀结束后大概是看了看气象观测系统（AMeDAS）？笑着说“雨云正朝横滨飘过来了！笑”——这成了美好的回忆。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After the talk event, Mr. Sumikawa from Lisani!, who appeared with me yesterday, looked at what was probably the AMeDAS radar and laughed, \"A rain cloud is heading for Yokohama! lol\", which is a fond memory."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いつも優しく楽しくサポートしてくださり、澄川さん本当に本当にありがとうございます。今後ともこのポンコツをお助けください(_ _).｡o○"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "您总是温柔而愉快地支持着我，澄川さん，真的真的非常感谢。今后也请继续多帮帮这个笨手笨脚的家伙(_ _).｡o○"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mr. Sumikawa, thank you so, so much for always supporting me so kindly and so cheerfully. Please keep helping this good-for-nothing of mine in the future(_ _).｡o○"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そして、そしてーーー！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还有，还有——！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And, and, and!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "card",
        "title": "インターネットラジオステーション＜音泉＞",
        "url": "http://www.onsen.ag/program/sword_oratoria/",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170525061320/http://www.onsen.ag/program/sword_oratoria/",
        "image": {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "インターネットラジオステーション＜音泉＞",
          "media": "d94d3d213fc8.jpg",
          "source": "http://www.onsen.ag/common/img/share/thumb.jpg"
        },
        "description": "インターネットラジオステーション＜音泉＞はアニメ・ゲーム・声優系を中心としたラジオを配信するサイトです。すべての番組が無料で楽しむことができ、しかも登録などの煩わしい作業が一切不要です。誰でも手軽にご利用頂くことが可能です。スマートフォンにも対応！"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2017/5/26 音泉（Webラジオ）「ソード・オラトリア」～魔導士とアマゾネス～に、ゲスト出演させていただきます(o^^o)！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2017/5/26 我将作为嘉宾出演音泉（网络电台）的《剑姬神圣谭》～魔导士与亚马逊～(o^^o)！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On 2017/5/26, I'll be a guest on Onsen (web radio) \"Sword Oratoria ~The Mage and the Amazon~\"(o^^o)!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日のリリイベでもちょっと触れていましたね笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天的发行活动上也稍微提了一嘴这件事呢，笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I touched on it a little at yesterday's release event too lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃のド！ポンコツトークを、木村さんが優しく高橋さんが楽しくお二人が包んで下さっています。アニメともどもこちらも合わせてよろしくお願いします\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "8ca24e2a3a95.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00093.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹿乃那笨到不行的闲聊，多亏了木村さん温柔地、高橋さん愉快地——两位一起帮我兜着。动画也好，这档节目也罢，都请一并多多关照！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mr. Kimura gently and Mr. Takahashi cheerfully wrap Kano's totally good-for-nothing talk in warmth. Please check this out along with the anime"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "a71b65410e5f.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00111.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "また！！！昨日リリースされたTVアニメ「ソード・オラトリア ダンジョンに出会いを求めるのは間違っているだろうか 外伝」井口裕香さんのOP、鹿乃のEDのCDにも猛烈出会ってください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还有！！！昨天发售的 TV 动画《剑姬神圣谭（期待在地下城邂逅有错吗 外传）》里，井口裕香さん的 OP、鹿乃的 ED，也请大家猛烈地去邂逅这些 CD！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Also!!! Please go and eagerly meet the CD of the OP by Yuka Iguchi and the ED by Kano for the TV anime \"Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? On the Side: Sword Oratoria\", which was released yesterday."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
